    "Hook question: why did poverty jump more in one year than ever before? Answer, built scene by scene: pandemic aid like the expanded Child Tax Credit expired, inflation raised the bar, and the pain landed hardest in California, the Florida panhandle and the Mississippi Delta, even for people who work. The close names the fix from the article: expand the EITC and CTC.",
